WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:03.726
A block takes the full width, an inline box sits in the line

2
00:00:04.454 --> 00:00:09.104
The span's gold hugs its words. The div's gold runs across the page.

3
00:00:10.158 --> 00:00:13.383
A block starts a new line and takes the full width.

4
00:00:14.186 --> 00:00:17.361
An inline box sits inside the line of text.

5
00:00:18.214 --> 00:00:21.289
Display block makes the span act like a div.
